积墙体改动是否会影响层流无菌舱的百级洁净度标准？","timestamp":"2026-04-08T09:17:59.523Z","roundId":"group_bg_1775639879523_pfgq9y5","isBackgroundMsg":true,"userId":"uid_1775439066406_15cp2jkiv","characterId":"group_1775538772255","_id":1107},{"id":1775639879646.5427,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"16507844-6b79-4368-93ba-9128836ac79a","senderName":"梅奥","text":"只要资金跟得上，采用航天级气密性材料和独立送风系统就可以解决感染风险。但我必须提醒你们，第一阶段的肿瘤细胞减灭术加上43℃的腹腔热灌注，对她那具已经透支的身体是毁灭性的打击。留给你们伤春悲秋的时间不多了，最迟明早，我要看到她躺在手术台上。","timestamp":"2026-04-08T09:17:59.646Z","roundId":"group_bg_1775639879523_pfgq9y5","isBackgroundMsg":true,"userId":"uid_1775439066406_15cp2jkiv","characterId":"group_1775538772255","_id":1108},{"id":1775639879698.944,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"62a7a89d-b4ac-478a-bada-eb79925089f0","senderName":"周少奇","text":"都怪我……如果前阵子我没有为了逃避家里安排出国的破事躲着不见人，如果我早点发现她吃不下东西根本不是普通的胃炎……我真的想扇死我自己！","timestamp":"2026-04-08T09:17:59.698Z","roundId":"group_bg_1775639879523_pfgq9y5","isBackgroundMsg":true,"userId":"uid_1775439066406_15cp2jkiv","characterId":"group_1775538772255","_id":1109},{"id":1775639879738.5767,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"cf7f89db-6f4e-4f6c-bce5-2249c1da3bf9","senderName":"寅商宴","text":"闭嘴。要论该死，也是我这个亲自执行穷养计划、看着她为了省钱连吃顿好的都舍不得的混账哥哥先死。","timestamp":"2026-04-08T09:17:59.738Z","roundId":"group_bg_1775639879523_pfgq9y5","isBackgroundMsg":true,"userId":"uid_1775439066406_15cp2jkiv","characterId":"group_1775538772255","_id":1110},{"id":1775639879769.856,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"cf7f89db-6f4e-4f6c-bce5-2249c1da3bf9","senderName":"寅商宴","text":"@严明 今晚十点前，我要看到无菌舱改造的最终图纸。不计代价，我要她做完骨髓移植、在里面最痛最熬不住的时候，睁开眼就能看到我。","timestamp":"2026-04-08T09:17:59.769Z","roundId":"group_bg_1775639879523_pfgq9y5","isBackgroundMsg":true,"userId":"uid_1775439066406_15cp2jkiv","characterId":"group_1775538772255","_id":1111},{"id":"sys_1775641548686_lr","sender":"system","type":"system_notice","text":"林汐 加入了群聊","includeInContext":false,"contextText":"","timestamp":"2026-04-08T09:45:48.686Z","userId":"uid_1775439066406_15cp2jkiv","characterId":"group